        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Groupel</strong>, a strategic roguelike where luck is nothing but an illusion… and chance itself becomes a weapon to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with a handful of chips. Your goal: <strong>survive round after round</strong> by reaching the required target each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware — the house doesn’t forgive mistakes. One bad bet, and everything can crumble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, visit the <strong>croupier’s shop</strong>, a shady yet charming dealer ready to sell you <strong>jokers that can rewrite the rules of the game</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiply your winnings, rig the colors, influence the ball’s path, or bend the odds in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own synergy, combine effects, and discover unexpected strategies to defy fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique — new jokers, new challenges, new chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game adapts to your success: the better you do, the higher the stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll need to <strong>take risks, play with probability, and turn your mistakes into opportunities</strong> to push your luck further than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🃏 Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 A <strong>reimagined roulette gameplay</strong> turned into a strategic roguelike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Over <strong>100 unique jokers</strong> with varied and sometimes absurd effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Endless combinations</strong> to craft your own playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 A <strong>mysterious shop</strong>, filled with shady deals and tempting offers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 A rich <strong>casino atmosphere</strong> — roulette spins, whispers, and clinking glasses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 <strong>Progressive difficulty</strong> where fortune favors the bold.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question isn’t whether you’ll win…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but <strong>how long you’ll last before luck runs out.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Groupel</strong>, a strategic roguelike where luck is nothing but an illusion… and chance itself becomes a weapon to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with a handful of chips. Your goal: <strong>survive round after round</strong> by reaching the required target each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware — the house doesn’t forgive mistakes. One bad bet, and everything can crumble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, visit the <strong>croupier’s shop</strong>, a shady yet charming dealer ready to sell you <strong>jokers that can rewrite the rules of the game</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiply your winnings, rig the colors, influence the ball’s path, or bend the odds in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own synergy, combine effects, and discover unexpected strategies to defy fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique — new jokers, new challenges, new chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game adapts to your success: the better you do, the higher the stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll need to <strong>take risks, play with probability, and turn your mistakes into opportunities</strong> to push your luck further than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🃏 Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 A <strong>reimagined roulette gameplay</strong> turned into a strategic roguelike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Over <strong>100 unique jokers</strong> with varied and sometimes absurd effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Endless combinations</strong> to craft your own playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 A <strong>mysterious shop</strong>, filled with shady deals and tempting offers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 A rich <strong>casino atmosphere</strong> — roulette spins, whispers, and clinking glasses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 <strong>Progressive difficulty</strong> where fortune favors the bold.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question isn’t whether you’ll win…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but <strong>how long you’ll last before luck runs out.</strong></p>",
